### Guest creates a booking without login
POST http://localhost:5290/api/booking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerName": "Guest Test",
  "passengerPhone": "01712345678",
  "passengerEmail": "guest@example.com",
  "busId": "{{busId}}",
  "seatNumber": "I1"
}

